<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Chrysalis Int'l.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Chrysalis Int'l.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Southcoast Capital Corp said it downgraded Chrysalis International Corp to short-term buy from strong buy. The long-term rating remained strong buy.</p>
<p>-- cut the 1997 first quarter earnings per share estimate to a loss of $0.02 a share from a profit of $0.01 a share.</p>
<p>-- said cut the second quarter 1997 estimate to profit $0.01 a share from profit $0.03 a share.</p>
<p>-- cut the full year 1997 earnings estimate to profit $0.09 a share from $0.14 a share.</p>
<p>-- said 12-18 month price target of $9 to $11 a share is &quot;still achievable.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Chrysalis gained one to 5-3/4 in morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
